  "sangamTamil": "புல்லா வெழுத்திற் பொருளில் வறுங்கோட்டி\nகல்லா ஒருவன் உரைப்பவும் கண்ணோடி\nநல்லார் வருந்தியும் கேட்பரே, மற்றவன்\nபல்லாருள் நாணல் பரிந்து.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The good listen with patient courtesy to the orations of the ignorant. Even when one speaks who has an ungrammatical knowledge of the letter, but not of the meaning who is of a low (empty) school, and is unlearned the good with kindly compassion will listen, though it is pain to them, being grieved that he should be put to shame in the presence of many.",
